  "details": "1. Go to Inventory > Cosmetics > UI Themes\n\n2. Click edit on a scheme or make a new scheme.\n\n3. Click the share button, then the X to close the share modal\n\n4. The color picker is now stuck open, X and Cancel buttons no longer work, and Apply applies changes but does not close picker. Closing the menu will close the picker, but the buttons still wont close it next time you open it, even without having to go though the share step.",
